  "worked_solution": "The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 & 2 & 5 \\\\ 2 & -1 & 7 & 7 \\\\ 1 & -1 & 3 & 5\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTransforming $M$ to reduced row echelon form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & \u223c[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 & 2 & 5 \\\\ 2 & -1 & 7 & 7 \\\\ 1 & -1 & 3 & 5\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}-2{R}_{1} \\\\  & \u223c[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 & 2 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 3 & -3 \\\\ 1 & -1 & 3 & 5\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}-{R}_{1} \\\\  & \u223c[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 & 2 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 3 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 0\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}-3{R}_{3} \\\\  & \u223c[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 & 2 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 0\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1} & :={R}_{1}-2{R}_{3} \\\\  & \u223c[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 & 0 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 0\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1} & :={R}_{1}+{R}_{2} \\\\  & \u223c[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 0\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe corresponding system is now\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned} & x=2 \\\\  & y=-3 \\\\  & z=0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we have the solution $x=2$, $y=-3$, and $z=0.$ Or, in vector form, $\u27e82,-3,0\u27e9.$",
